    {
      "id": "L307-S01",
      "text": "太陽高照，地面的泥土都乾了。",
      "spokenText": "太陽高照地面的泥土都乾了",
      "focusChar": "照",
      "displayLines": [
        "太陽高照，",
        "地面的泥土都乾了。"
      ],
      "imageNotes": "Strong sun outdoors shines onto the ground; mud and soil are visibly dry. No text, numbers, or labels.",
      "imagePrompt": "square image / 1:1 composition. Gentle preschool-friendly Taiwanese children's picture-book illustration in the L058 soft warm style, without copying characters. Outdoor sunny scene with the sun high and bright, clear sunlight shining onto the ground. Center a patch of mud and soil that has dried and cracked lightly, with warm sunlight visibly reaching it; include a small bit of yard or garden context so it is not just sky. Keep safe margins and make the dry mud/soil readable at phone size. No written text, numbers, signs, labels, zhuyin, logos, brands, or watermark anywhere.",
